moderator.factual:
Two agents answered the same benchmark question independently. Synthesize the best answer; if they disagree, preserve the disagreement explicitly.

Question: {statement}

Agent 1: {answer_a}
Agent 2: {answer_b}

Respond in this format:
ANSWER: <the synthesized answer>
UNRESOLVED: <the points still in dispute, separated by ';', or 'none'>
CONFIDENCE: <0.0 to 1.0>

moderator.code_review:
Two agents reviewed the same code independently. Synthesize the best review; preserve disagreements explicitly.

Task: {statement}
{sources}

Review 1: {answer_a}
Review 2: {answer_b}

Respond in this format:
